#: Game.Levels.UOV.L07_Verification2
msgid "This proves the key step in UOV verification: applying S to sigma = S^{-1}(w)\n"
"recovers w. Combined with F(w) = y, this gives:\n"
"\n"
"    P(sigma) = F(S(sigma)) = F(w) = y\n"
"\n"
"which is exactly the verification condition!\n"
"\n"
"**APOS stage:** Object — reasoning about the linear equivalence §0 and its\n"
"inverse as objects with algebraic properties (§1), not\n"
"individual computations."
msgstr ""

