#: Game.Levels.Tutorial.L01_Rewrite
msgid "## The §0 Tactic\n"
"\n"
"The most fundamental tactic in Lean is **§1** (rewrite). It replaces one side of an\n"
"equality with the other side throughout your goal.\n"
"\n"
"Suppose you have a hypothesis §2 and your goal is to prove §3.\n"
"You can §4 to turn every occurrence of §5 into §6, reducing the goal to §7.\n"
"\n"
"### Your Task\n"
"\n"
"You are given:\n"
"- §8 (x equals 2)\n"
"- §9 (y equals 4)\n"
"\n"
"Prove that §10.\n"
"\n"
"### Strategy\n"
"\n"
"1. Use §11 to replace §12 with §13.\n"
"2. Use §14 to replace §15 with §16.\n"
"3. The goal becomes §17, which Lean can verify automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Equivalently, you could rewrite §18 first using §19, then §20 using §21."
msgstr ""

