#: Game.Levels.PublicKeyCrypto.L02_ModEqToolkit
msgid "## Combining Facts, Not Just Numbers\n"
"\n"
"So far, every congruence (§0) you've worked with came from a\n"
"single named theorem (Fermat, Euler). Real RSA proofs need to *combine*\n"
"congruences: if you know §1, you can safely raise both sides\n"
"to a power, or multiply both sides by the same thing, and the congruence\n"
"survives.\n"
"\n"
"### Your Task\n"
"\n"
"Given §2, prove that §3 for any\n"
"§4 and §5.\n"
"\n"
"### Strategy\n"
"\n"
"First lift the congruence through the exponent §6, then multiply both\n"
"sides by §7."
