#: Game.Levels.SecretSharing.L02_PolynomialRing
msgid "## Does §0 Still Work Here?\n"
"\n"
"§1 — polynomials with coefficients in a field §2 — is itself a\n"
"commutative ring, with its own §3, §4, and a distinguished element §5\n"
"(the indeterminate). Every identity you've ever closed with §6 was\n"
"really a fact about *any* commutative ring, §7 included.\n"
"\n"
"### Your Task\n"
"\n"
"Prove §8 in §9.\n"
"\n"
"### Strategy\n"
"\n"
"This is the exact same shape of identity from Tutorial World — just in a\n"
"ring whose elements are polynomials instead of numbers."
