#: Game.Levels.UOV.L02_LinearMap
msgid "## Linear Maps in Lean\n"
"\n"
"In UOV, the secret transformation S is an invertible linear map on F^n.\n"
"In Mathlib, a linear map from module §0 to module §1 is §2\n"
"(read: linear map from M to N).\n"
"\n"
"The composition of linear maps §3 and §4 is written §5 (first apply §6,\n"
"then §7).\n"
"\n"
"### Cryptographic Context\n"
"\n"
"In UOV, the public key is P = F composed with S. Here, S is a\n"
"linear map and F is a quadratic map. The composition F composed with S\n"
"means: first apply S to the input, then apply F.\n"
"\n"
"### Your Task\n"
"\n"
"Prove that applying the composition §8 to a vector §9 gives §10.\n"
"\n"
"### Strategy\n"
"\n"
"Use the lemma §11, which states §12."
msgstr ""

