#: Game.Levels.ModularArithmetic.L04_Homomorphism
msgid "## 'Raise to the e-th Power' as a Single Object\n"
"\n"
"In the last level, exponentiation was something you performed on individual\n"
"elements. Now step back and treat 'raise everything to the power §0' as an\n"
"**object** in its own right: a function on §1 with its own structural\n"
"property — it turns products into products:\n"
"\n"
"    (m1 * m2) ^ e = m1 ^ e * m2 ^ e\n"
"\n"
"This is exactly the algebraic fact behind RSA's well-known **multiplicative\n"
"homomorphic property**: encrypting a product of two messages gives the same\n"
"result as multiplying their individual encryptions.\n"
"\n"
"### Your Task\n"
"\n"
"Prove this distributive law for arbitrary §2 and §3.\n"
"\n"
"### Strategy\n"
"\n"
"Another one-and-for-all Mathlib fact for commutative monoids: §4."
msgstr ""

