#: Game.Levels.PublicKeyCrypto.L04_ElGamal
msgid "## Diffie–Hellman, Wearing a Disguise\n"
"\n"
"**ElGamal encryption** publishes a group generator §0 and §1 (Alice's\n"
"public key, secret exponent §2). To encrypt §3 under a random one-time\n"
"secret §4, Bob sends §5. Alice decrypts by\n"
"computing §6 and dividing it out.\n"
"\n"
"For decryption to recover §7, Alice's computed mask §8 must\n"
"equal Bob's masking factor §9 — which is exactly the\n"
"Diffie–Hellman identity from Modular Arithmetic World, dressed in new\n"
"variable names.\n"
"\n"
"### Your Task\n"
"\n"
"Prove §10.\n"
"\n"
"### Strategy\n"
"\n"
"No hints spell out the steps this time — but you've closed a goal of\n"
"exactly this shape before."
msgstr ""

