#: Game.Levels.PublicKeyCrypto.L03_ExponentSplit
msgid "## Why the Key Relation Has a '+1' in It\n"
"\n"
"RSA's key relation §0 means, unpacked, that\n"
"§1 for some whole number §2. That '+1' is exactly what\n"
"survives at the end; the §3 part is exactly what Euler's Theorem is\n"
