#: Game.Levels.GroupsAndOrders.L05_Capstone
msgid "## Setting Up Diffie–Hellman's Public Group\n"
"\n"
"A **generator** of a finite group §0 is an element §1 whose order equals\n"
"the size of the whole group — repeating §2 visits every single element of\n"
"§3 before returning to §4. Diffie–Hellman and ElGamal both start by\n"
"publishing such a §5, together with the group's order, as shared public\n"
"parameters.\n"
"\n"
"### Your Task\n"
"\n"
