"\n"
"A Shamir dealer picks a secret value, builds a polynomial §0 that carries\n"
"that secret as §1 (the value at input §2, which no participant's\n"
"share ever reveals directly), and hands out §3 to each\n"
"participant §4 at their own point §5.\n"
